WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 36=

02:01.720 --> 02:04.000
(Outside the Imperial Prison)

02:16.760 --> 02:17.800
Will this plan work?

02:17.880 --> 02:19.360
Even if you don't trust the Chancellor,

02:19.440 --> 02:21.880
don't you at least trust
the Princess?

02:27.320 --> 02:27.960
Report!

02:29.280 --> 02:31.040
Your Highness,
they killed the guards outside.

02:31.120 --> 02:32.080
But they didn't enter.

02:32.800 --> 02:33.480
What?

02:33.680 --> 02:35.640
I didn't see Jiang Changjue either.

02:41.160 --> 02:43.520
Cui Wei, take your men
and launch a counterattack.

02:43.600 --> 02:44.640
Try to capture them alive.

02:45.640 --> 02:47.440
If Qian Mochen isn't enough
to lure him out,

02:47.920 --> 02:49.160
we'll catch a few more.

02:50.600 --> 02:52.400
Jiang Changjue
will show up sooner or later.

02:53.160 --> 02:54.000
Yes, Your Highness.

02:55.840 --> 02:56.440
Follow me!

03:10.720 --> 03:12.560
Stop them
and buy the Chancellor some time.

03:14.000 --> 03:14.600
Wait!

03:22.000 --> 03:22.800
Watch them closely.

03:31.720 --> 03:32.320
Your Highness,

03:32.960 --> 03:34.240
I saw Qingtai

03:34.320 --> 03:35.640
and Shen Zaiye's guards.

03:36.400 --> 03:38.560
Jiang Taohua and Shen Zaiye
have returned to Hao City?

03:41.120 --> 03:41.880
What were you doing?

03:41.960 --> 03:43.520
How could you not detect even
a hint of it?

03:43.600 --> 03:44.720
It was my failure in duty.

03:45.600 --> 03:46.200
But

03:46.400 --> 03:48.360
I didn't see them myself.

03:49.480 --> 03:51.480
I only overheard the guard saying,

03:51.760 --> 03:52.400
"Hold them off

03:52.480 --> 03:53.800
and buy the Chancellor some time."

03:55.160 --> 03:56.160
"Hold them off"?

03:59.240 --> 04:01.640
Could they have discovered
Qian Mochen's location?

04:04.560 --> 04:05.680
Check the hidden sand cave now.

04:05.760 --> 04:06.520
Yes, Your Highness.

04:20.600 --> 04:21.680
Chancellor. Your Highness.

04:22.000 --> 04:23.320
As expected, Cui Wei left in a hurry

04:23.400 --> 04:24.320
through the back entrance

04:24.400 --> 04:25.360
with a few men.

04:26.360 --> 04:27.120
They took the bait.

04:28.520 --> 04:30.960
Then we should make a move
to pick up the State Preceptor.

04:36.560 --> 04:37.640
Is something troubling you?

04:38.640 --> 04:39.680
Is the poison acting up?

04:40.200 --> 04:40.800
No.

04:41.360 --> 04:42.280
Then what's the matter?

04:44.960 --> 04:45.560
Nothing.

04:46.920 --> 04:48.080
I'm just scared.

04:56.640 --> 04:57.240
Taohua,

04:58.640 --> 04:59.240
don't worry.

05:00.680 --> 05:01.280
I'm here.

05:39.200 --> 05:39.800
Changjue,

05:40.360 --> 05:41.000
you stay here.

05:41.320 --> 05:42.240
We'll go check it out.

05:42.640 --> 05:43.240
All right.

05:44.200 --> 05:45.400
The four of you, come with me.

06:00.400 --> 06:01.000
Commander Cui.

06:01.840 --> 06:02.760
Any unusual activity?

06:02.840 --> 06:04.440
Commander Cui, everything is clear, sir.

06:04.800 --> 06:07.480
Send a letter to Her Highness
to inform her that nothing is unusual.

06:08.040 --> 06:08.640
Yes, sir.

06:12.440 --> 06:13.040
Follow him.

06:34.720 --> 06:35.320
This way.

06:48.720 --> 06:49.320
Wait here.

07:00.440 --> 07:01.320
Go and inform Changjue

07:01.440 --> 07:02.280
and set the ambush.

07:02.880 --> 07:03.480
Yes, sir.

07:03.560 --> 07:06.280
(Secret transport. Palace now.)
We need to lure Empress Lv to this spot.

07:06.360 --> 07:08.040
(Safe and secure.
Proceed with the siege.)

07:09.040 --> 07:11.000
(Proceed with the siege)

07:11.080 --> 07:11.680
Who's there?

07:14.320 --> 07:14.920
Stop them.

07:15.280 --> 07:16.200
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

07:27.800 --> 07:28.680
I'll hold off Cui Wei.

07:29.880 --> 07:30.760
You find Qian Mochen.

07:31.560 --> 07:32.200
Be careful.

07:53.240 --> 07:53.880
Master.

07:56.440 --> 07:57.040
Master.

08:00.560 --> 08:01.280
Master.

08:03.200 --> 08:03.800
I…

08:05.680 --> 08:07.760
I told An Chu

08:09.480 --> 08:10.800
not to let you get involved.

08:12.200 --> 08:13.760
How could I abandon you?

08:14.840 --> 08:16.680
Changjue has been praying
for your safe return.

08:22.160 --> 08:22.760
At least,

08:24.960 --> 08:26.720
you're finally calling me
"Master" again.

08:29.560 --> 08:30.160
Have you found

08:31.280 --> 08:32.000
Changjue?

08:32.320 --> 08:32.919
Yes.

08:33.840 --> 08:34.440
Good.

08:35.559 --> 08:38.840
The three of us
have finally put the past behind us.

08:39.679 --> 08:40.840
All that's left is to reunite.

08:45.960 --> 08:47.600
Your safety is all that matters.

08:50.600 --> 08:51.200
I protected you

08:53.360 --> 08:55.040
and your brother

08:56.600 --> 08:58.160
out of gratitude to the late Empress.

08:59.480 --> 09:00.080
Now,

09:01.000 --> 09:03.600
I've repaid the kindness I owed.

09:04.720 --> 09:06.240
So I have no regrets now.

09:08.000 --> 09:09.120
You should be happy

09:09.640 --> 09:10.720
for me.

09:11.800 --> 09:12.400
Master,

09:14.360 --> 09:15.480
you once said,

09:16.520 --> 09:18.520
"True courage is knowing
something is impossible

09:18.960 --> 09:20.320
and doing it anyway."

09:21.720 --> 09:22.320
So today,

09:23.200 --> 09:24.840
I will get you out of here.

09:43.040 --> 09:43.920
Report!

09:45.680 --> 09:48.160
Your Highness, we received a message
from the hidden sand cave.

09:48.440 --> 09:49.840
They've called for reinforcements.

09:54.560 --> 09:56.640
Mobilize everyone
and head to the hidden sand cave.

09:56.720 --> 09:57.560
Yes, Your Highness.

10:00.400 --> 10:01.760
Cui Wei may return at any moment.

10:02.040 --> 10:03.480
Master, we must go now.

10:09.320 --> 10:10.880
Unlocking the chains takes time.

10:11.680 --> 10:12.600
Leave me.

10:32.880 --> 10:35.320
Use your wrist as a pivot

10:36.200 --> 10:40.120
and slowly release pressure
through your fingers.

10:50.760 --> 10:51.920
Now! Charge!

10:52.360 --> 10:53.080
Kill him!

10:57.240 --> 10:57.840
(Darn it.)

10:57.960 --> 10:59.640
(Of all times,
the poison flares up now.)

12:03.880 --> 12:04.480
Your Highness.

12:29.840 --> 12:30.480
It's an ambush!

12:31.240 --> 12:32.120
Protect Her Highness!

12:36.840 --> 12:38.040
Fall back! Move!

12:58.680 --> 13:00.680
- Charge!
- Kill them!

13:04.840 --> 13:06.280
Kill!

13:07.480 --> 13:08.280
(Jiang Changjue.)

13:11.200 --> 13:12.600
(No, this was a trap!)

13:16.120 --> 13:16.800
Kill him now!

13:16.880 --> 13:18.360
If Empress Lv finds out he's alive,

13:18.720 --> 13:19.600
we're dead!

13:51.480 --> 13:52.360
The key

13:54.400 --> 13:56.200
is a steady hand.

13:57.040 --> 14:00.040
The lock's tumblers
must flow like water.

14:13.200 --> 14:13.880
I've unlocked it.

15:00.880 --> 15:01.680
Fight your way out!

15:01.760 --> 15:02.880
Escort me back to the palace!

15:07.240 --> 15:07.880
Empress Lv,

15:09.520 --> 15:10.960
you caused the Luocheng massacre,

15:11.280 --> 15:13.520
which led innocent people
to lose their homes and lives.

15:14.320 --> 15:15.400
You murdered

15:16.080 --> 15:17.440
my mother!

15:18.160 --> 15:19.960
You also poisoned

15:21.240 --> 15:22.800
my sister!

15:24.960 --> 15:26.360
You're ruthless and heartless!

15:26.880 --> 15:28.120
Heaven itself won't forgive you!

15:29.200 --> 15:29.920
Empress Lv,

15:31.280 --> 15:32.560
do you admit your crimes?

15:33.520 --> 15:35.400
Who are you to judge me?

15:36.720 --> 15:37.800
Whoever kills Jiang Changjue

15:38.280 --> 15:39.360
will be generously rewarded!

15:39.520 --> 15:41.040
- Kill!
- Kill!

15:41.480 --> 15:42.200
Kill!

15:46.200 --> 15:47.680
Retreat! Head east!

15:54.000 --> 15:55.400
Empress Lv is here! Take her down!

15:57.120 --> 15:57.720
Move!

16:01.560 --> 16:02.160
Head north!

16:04.520 --> 16:07.840
- Kill!
- Kill!

16:09.200 --> 16:09.800
Kill them all!

16:18.320 --> 16:19.400
Empress Lv, stop running!

16:56.840 --> 16:57.480
Empress Lv,

16:58.480 --> 16:59.320
this is your end.

16:59.600 --> 17:00.560
Fate has decided it.

17:01.760 --> 17:03.480
Why keep struggling?

17:08.839 --> 17:09.880
Hand over the antidote,

17:10.720 --> 17:12.280
and I'll leave your body whole.

17:13.560 --> 17:14.359
Never.

17:14.880 --> 17:15.880
If I'm going down,

17:16.839 --> 17:18.440
I'm dragging Jiang Taohua with me!

17:19.240 --> 17:19.880
Kill him!

17:25.920 --> 17:27.920
Let's go to the secret tunnel
in the northwest.

17:41.280 --> 17:41.880
Master,

17:42.400 --> 17:43.000
this way.

17:45.800 --> 17:46.680
Here, let me help you.

18:06.520 --> 18:07.120
Master!

18:34.560 --> 18:35.200
Chancellor,

18:36.040 --> 18:36.640
you are…

18:36.800 --> 18:37.400
I'm fine.

18:39.640 --> 18:40.360
Are you all right?

18:41.200 --> 18:41.800
I'm all right.

18:42.040 --> 18:42.640
Master.

18:43.240 --> 18:43.840
Master.

18:46.920 --> 18:47.520
Empress Lv?

18:48.000 --> 18:48.720
Stop right there!

18:52.120 --> 18:52.720
Princess.

18:53.160 --> 18:53.760
The antidote.

18:54.480 --> 18:55.080
Go and get it.

18:55.440 --> 18:56.040
But…

18:56.120 --> 18:56.720
I'll be fine.

18:57.400 --> 18:58.000
Go ahead.

19:00.960 --> 19:01.560
Go.

19:03.000 --> 19:03.600
Master,

19:03.800 --> 19:04.760
wait for me right here.

19:05.200 --> 19:05.800
All right.

19:23.600 --> 19:24.480
Jiang Taohua,

19:26.120 --> 19:27.160
we meet again.

19:27.720 --> 19:28.320
Empress Lv,

19:29.600 --> 19:30.680
there's no escape this time.

19:31.560 --> 19:32.960
Today will be the day you die.

19:35.440 --> 19:37.560
Who's to say I couldn't escape?

19:38.520 --> 19:40.320
Maybe I just didn't want to.

19:40.400 --> 19:41.920
You've committed countless atrocities.

19:42.400 --> 19:44.080
Now, retribution has finally come
for you.

19:45.840 --> 19:46.640
Retribution?

19:48.800 --> 19:50.560
Oh, spare me the righteousness.

19:51.560 --> 19:53.360
Who are you to stand for justice

19:53.440 --> 19:55.000
and judge me as if I'm pure evil?

19:56.400 --> 19:57.000
Listen.

19:58.520 --> 19:59.960
I rose to the height of power

20:00.040 --> 20:01.120
through my efforts.

20:03.760 --> 20:04.680
How is that wrong?

20:08.040 --> 20:09.040
You're blind to your sins

20:09.400 --> 20:10.280
and shameless.

20:10.880 --> 20:11.480
Empress Lv,

20:12.360 --> 20:13.440
you're at your end.

20:14.200 --> 20:15.000
Hand over Yinghuo.

20:18.240 --> 20:19.880
So you've learned about Yinghuo.

20:24.200 --> 20:26.440
That means Mei Ling is in your hands.

20:27.160 --> 20:28.080
Don't trust her.

20:29.600 --> 20:30.600
She won't give it to us.

20:40.440 --> 20:42.560
What a touching couple you two make.

20:44.360 --> 20:45.560
How disgusting.

20:48.440 --> 20:49.760
Are you jealous?

20:51.720 --> 20:53.320
You could've had all this.

20:54.040 --> 20:55.640
My father favored you.

20:56.000 --> 20:57.080
Yet you wanted more.

20:58.440 --> 20:59.680
Mu Wuyin loved you deeply.

21:00.080 --> 21:01.480
But you only used him.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.000
What a joke!

21:08.720 --> 21:11.120
Do you think I care about love?

21:19.600 --> 21:20.760
If I were jealous of you,

21:22.320 --> 21:24.240
it was your birthright.

21:27.080 --> 21:28.160
Jiang Taohua,

21:29.400 --> 21:30.880
you were born a princess,

21:31.360 --> 21:33.200
protected by your noble family.

21:33.280 --> 21:35.000
What would you know of my ambition?

21:36.000 --> 21:36.840
Your father,

21:37.200 --> 21:38.520
the so-called Emperor,

21:38.680 --> 21:39.640
was a lustful fool.

21:40.120 --> 21:43.280
Mu Wuyin was the son of an Emperor.
But he was weak and useless.

21:43.680 --> 21:45.760
What do they have that I don't
besides noble birth?

21:46.120 --> 21:48.280
Why should I bow to any of you?

21:51.600 --> 21:55.160
I clawed my way to the top.

21:56.400 --> 21:58.400
I'll rule this world!

21:59.400 --> 22:00.320
No one

22:00.400 --> 22:02.240
will ever step on me again!

22:04.680 --> 22:05.800
Even without noble birth,

22:06.560 --> 22:07.920
what makes you better than them?

22:09.000 --> 22:11.000
You murdered loyal officials,
stole from the people,

22:11.080 --> 22:12.760
and lived in luxury
while the people starved.

22:12.840 --> 22:15.040
You've ruled Beiyuan into the ground
all these years.

22:15.360 --> 22:16.400
The people are in misery,

22:16.840 --> 22:17.880
and the state is crumbling.

22:18.840 --> 22:19.720
Your downfall

22:20.360 --> 22:22.000
is your own making.

22:25.840 --> 22:27.840
What do you know?

22:27.960 --> 22:29.240
You know nothing!

22:30.800 --> 22:35.280
I had a grand vision for this land!

22:38.400 --> 22:40.200
Chancellor,
no point talking sense with her.

22:41.080 --> 22:42.320
She won't change.

22:58.840 --> 22:59.520
Those are…

23:00.600 --> 23:01.200
Yinghuo.

23:07.000 --> 23:07.880
You want Yinghuo?

23:08.400 --> 23:09.160
In your dreams!

23:23.040 --> 23:25.240
I've already doused
this entire place in oil.

23:26.080 --> 23:27.640
I'll burn Yinghuo to ash

23:27.720 --> 23:28.760
right before your eyes!

23:29.920 --> 23:30.840
Shen Zaiye,

23:31.120 --> 23:32.960
I want you to watch
Jiang Taohua die in agony

23:33.080 --> 23:35.040
because of your incompetence!

23:45.720 --> 23:47.000
Finally starting to lose hope?

23:49.360 --> 23:50.720
Die! All of you!

24:06.240 --> 24:07.440
If it weren't for you,

24:07.840 --> 24:10.440
I would've already ruled the world!

24:11.600 --> 24:12.840
So long as you're dead,

24:13.360 --> 24:16.640
no one in this world can stop me!

24:21.360 --> 24:23.720
Taohua! Chancellor Shen! Lift this!

24:27.920 --> 24:29.280
Taohua, lift it!

24:40.920 --> 24:43.000
Qian Mochen, you traitor!

24:45.000 --> 24:45.640
Master!

24:51.640 --> 24:52.320
Taohua,

24:52.800 --> 24:53.680
don't worry about me.

24:54.240 --> 24:54.840
Just lift it!

25:04.200 --> 25:05.440
You want to save her?

25:05.680 --> 25:06.480
In your dreams!

25:13.120 --> 25:13.800
Master!

25:29.840 --> 25:30.760
Taohua, use more force!

25:30.920 --> 25:32.440
Qian Mochen can't hold out much longer!

25:40.760 --> 25:41.640
You can do it!

25:46.280 --> 25:46.880
Go now!

26:01.720 --> 26:02.440
Master!

26:05.560 --> 26:06.720
Go! Run! Master! Live, Taohua.

26:07.920 --> 26:09.120
Get out of here now!

26:09.640 --> 26:10.240
Master.

26:16.000 --> 26:18.680
You must live.

26:27.240 --> 26:28.440
Go!

26:46.880 --> 26:53.120
(Three days later)

27:24.120 --> 27:24.720
Taohua,

27:25.760 --> 27:26.360
you're awake.

27:26.440 --> 27:27.200
Your Highness.

27:27.320 --> 27:27.920
Taohua.

27:28.400 --> 27:29.640
Do you want to get up?

27:31.000 --> 27:31.600
Let me help.

27:32.360 --> 27:34.280
Physician Mei, quickly!

27:35.840 --> 27:36.440
Water…

27:39.720 --> 27:40.640
Drink slowly.

27:42.560 --> 27:43.720
Since Her Highness has awakened,

27:43.800 --> 27:46.040
the poison from the Jiangtao Pill
must've been neutralized.

27:46.120 --> 27:46.720
Really?

27:46.800 --> 27:48.280
I'll prepare
some medicinal meals for you.

27:48.360 --> 27:50.520
With a few days of rest,
you'll be back to full health.

27:51.320 --> 27:52.000
Neutralized?

27:52.960 --> 27:55.680
But Yinghuo was burned to ashes.

28:01.040 --> 28:01.640
Qingtai,

28:02.280 --> 28:03.240
where's the Chancellor?

28:21.520 --> 28:24.600
(That day, Chancellor risked his life
to retrieve a single stalk of Yinghuo.)

28:25.320 --> 28:27.040
(But it wasn't enough for both of you.)

28:27.120 --> 28:31.000
♪The brokenness buried in my brow♪

28:32.320 --> 28:33.600
(For you,)

28:34.160 --> 28:36.040
(he chose the lesser of the two.)

28:38.120 --> 28:42.480
♪Save for the slow crown
beneath whispered lips♪

28:42.840 --> 28:48.240
♪With no one to carry dreams
across the rivers wide♪

28:48.480 --> 28:51.440
(But he still has residual poisons
in his body from testing medicines.)

28:52.920 --> 28:55.000
(They're all mixed and complex.)

28:55.760 --> 28:57.120
(He's now unconscious.)

28:58.040 --> 28:58.920
(Physician Mei said,)

28:59.560 --> 29:00.600
(we're just using medicine)

29:00.680 --> 29:02.120
(to keep him alive for now)

29:03.320 --> 29:05.840
(and hold on as long as we can.)

29:05.920 --> 29:11.120
♪I was the one who had to take it away♪

29:12.480 --> 29:17.480
♪You weren't falling,
no need to feel all the sorrow and joy♪

29:18.240 --> 29:23.360
♪I wasn't someone meant
to wait and hope♪

29:23.880 --> 29:28.240
♪Don't blame my affection
for bringing you cold winds♪

29:28.520 --> 29:32.720
♪We were both unwilling to give in♪

29:33.880 --> 29:34.840
♪Who would've thought♪

29:34.920 --> 29:40.000
♪It began as a trial by fate♪

29:40.680 --> 29:45.560
♪Yet it turned into a fleeting bond,
lost to time♪

29:46.320 --> 29:50.800
♪Worn out from wandering,
with no shelter to rest beneath♪

29:51.080 --> 29:53.800
♪You never complained♪

29:53.920 --> 29:56.600
♪And I lay awake♪

29:56.680 --> 29:57.760
♪Who ever pitied us♪

29:57.840 --> 30:02.600
♪In those long, cold, uncertain years?♪

30:03.880 --> 30:05.760
♪What I offer now♪

30:06.480 --> 30:07.280
(Jiang Taohua,)

30:09.240 --> 30:10.040
(just remember)

30:11.120 --> 30:12.280
(that no matter what happens,)

30:13.840 --> 30:15.120
(you can always trust me.)

30:20.920 --> 30:26.480
♪Where petals fall and quiet words
are spoken over a game♪

30:26.600 --> 30:32.160
♪Tears draw out more tears
and what's seen is not truly seen♪

30:32.440 --> 30:37.800
♪If you walk away, looking back♪

30:38.200 --> 30:44.160
♪How many more years will I lose again?♪

30:49.600 --> 30:50.200
Your Highness,

30:51.160 --> 30:52.160
the Chancellor asked me

30:53.000 --> 30:54.000
to give you this.

31:07.680 --> 31:08.640
What is it?

31:12.440 --> 31:13.400
Yinghuo seeds.

32:04.040 --> 32:06.480
(Yinghuo needs
very specific conditions to grow.)

32:07.200 --> 32:09.480
(It grows deep in the desert caves.)

32:10.160 --> 32:11.240
(The moisture levels)

32:11.520 --> 32:12.760
(and changes in the sandy soil)

32:12.840 --> 32:14.400
(can affect its growth.)

32:15.720 --> 32:18.120
(Yinghuo is an extremely cold
and yin-based plant.)

32:18.960 --> 32:20.720
(Without the moonlight to sustain it,)

32:21.120 --> 32:22.600
(it may never bloom.)

32:45.600 --> 32:50.800
♪I'm lost for words when you turn away♪

32:51.720 --> 32:58.160
♪The closer our fluttering hearts
draw near, the more they try to hide♪

32:59.560 --> 33:05.840
♪The deeper my thoughts grow
for you at night♪

33:06.160 --> 33:11.160
♪The more afraid I am of losing you♪

33:13.080 --> 33:16.320
♪Your eyes sparkle like the stars
that adorn the night♪

33:16.440 --> 33:18.840
♪Ever so bright, ever so pure♪

33:19.880 --> 33:22.040
♪Reflecting all beneath
the heavens and the earth♪

33:22.200 --> 33:26.920
♪Because of you,
every scene is beautiful♪

33:27.120 --> 33:30.560
♪Though fierce winds rage,
the candle's flame burns warm♪

33:30.680 --> 33:33.920
♪Etching our longing into a vow♪

33:34.080 --> 33:37.360
♪Though parting looms,
no price too great to pay♪

33:37.560 --> 33:40.840
♪In life and death,
our hearts will never stray♪

33:41.080 --> 33:44.360
♪Those simple, ordinary days♪

33:44.440 --> 33:47.360
♪Feel like a dream of mine♪

33:48.120 --> 33:51.360
♪Humble meals a day♪

33:51.520 --> 33:54.000
♪Far away from worldly concerns♪

33:55.240 --> 33:59.000
♪Those memories become clear over time♪

33:59.120 --> 34:02.160
♪The long night passes in a flash♪

34:02.360 --> 34:03.520
(Heaven above,)

34:04.320 --> 34:05.720
(Shen Zaiye was poisoned)

34:06.200 --> 34:07.480
(because of me.)

34:08.920 --> 34:10.000
(Tonight, I ask)

34:10.840 --> 34:12.159
(for a bit of moonlight.)

34:12.679 --> 34:14.239
(So Yinghuo may bloom.)

34:15.600 --> 34:16.760
(I, Taohua,)

34:17.520 --> 34:18.840
(would give my life)

34:19.880 --> 34:22.120
(to light a lamp for Shen Zaiye.)

34:23.239 --> 34:24.960
(So he may live out his days in peace,)

34:25.760 --> 34:27.080
(free from all worries.)

34:27.159 --> 34:29.280
♪Ever so bright, ever so pure♪

34:30.400 --> 34:32.600
♪Reflecting all beneath
the heavens and the earth♪

34:32.679 --> 34:37.199
♪Because of you,
every scene is beautiful♪

34:37.600 --> 34:41.199
♪Though fierce winds rage,
the candle's flame burns warm♪

34:41.560 --> 34:44.560
♪Etching our longing into a vow♪

34:44.760 --> 34:48.040
♪Though parting looms,
no price too great to pay♪

34:48.159 --> 34:51.520
♪In life and death,
our hearts will never stray♪

34:51.639 --> 34:54.960
♪Those simple, ordinary days♪

34:55.080 --> 34:58.520
♪Gazing at nature
and recalling all those who flourished♪

34:58.760 --> 35:02.080
♪In that fleeting moment,
it felt as if I'd seen it all ♪

35:02.160 --> 35:05.720
♪A glimpse of eternity♪

35:05.840 --> 35:09.480
♪Those memories become clear over time♪

35:09.680 --> 35:12.880
♪Soft and endless like silken threads♪

35:13.040 --> 35:16.280
♪Driven by fate, an undying past♪

35:16.520 --> 35:21.520
♪Unfazed by the ending♪

35:35.880 --> 35:36.560
Physician Mei,

35:37.160 --> 35:38.240
why hasn't he woken up

35:38.320 --> 35:39.400
after taking the antidote?

35:40.160 --> 35:42.640
The poison had already reached
his organs.

35:43.400 --> 35:44.520
The damage it left behind

35:44.760 --> 35:46.520
won't heal so easily.

35:48.240 --> 35:50.600
His body is like a battlefield now.

35:50.880 --> 35:52.560
The poison
and the antidote fought it out.

35:53.040 --> 35:54.680
The antidote may have won the fight.

35:55.000 --> 35:57.040
But what's left is a land torn by war.

35:57.320 --> 35:58.680
Healing will take time.

36:02.040 --> 36:02.760
Physician Mei,

36:04.040 --> 36:05.400
is there any way to know how long?

36:06.160 --> 36:07.680
That's the problem.

36:08.480 --> 36:09.480
If we're lucky,

36:09.800 --> 36:11.240
he could wake up tomorrow.

36:12.440 --> 36:13.360
If not,

36:14.120 --> 36:15.920
he may never wake again.

36:36.160 --> 36:37.080
(Shen Zaiye,)

36:38.440 --> 36:39.440
(however long it takes,)

36:41.080 --> 36:42.400
(I'll be right here waiting.)

37:01.600 --> 37:02.760
What are you thinking about?

37:04.040 --> 37:05.000
In three months,

37:06.760 --> 37:08.280
snow will fall again in Beiyuan.

37:10.760 --> 37:11.520
I remember

37:11.840 --> 37:13.800
it snowed all the way

37:13.920 --> 37:15.960
from winter into spring one time.

37:16.800 --> 37:19.600
I cried and begged
to see the peach blossoms.

37:20.360 --> 37:22.440
So my mother carried me

37:22.520 --> 37:24.880
and we watched the snow fall
beneath the peach blossom tree.

37:25.000 --> 37:28.960
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

37:29.040 --> 37:30.000
Snow falls every year.

37:30.120 --> 37:31.600
It's not like you'll never see it again.

37:31.680 --> 37:33.520
♪Though shackles
bind my soul and chain my form♪

37:33.880 --> 37:34.480
(You're right.)

37:35.320 --> 37:36.960
(It's not like I'll never see it again.)

37:39.000 --> 37:45.360
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

37:45.920 --> 37:49.960
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

37:50.160 --> 37:53.080
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

37:53.200 --> 37:59.640
♪Forged in stardust and flame,
I rise with an unyielding frame♪

38:07.640 --> 38:14.640
♪I take your hand without a doubt,
one move decides our world♪

38:30.880 --> 38:33.680
(The End)

38:50.680 --> 38:53.880
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

38:53.960 --> 38:57.000
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

38:57.920 --> 39:01.040
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

39:01.160 --> 39:04.920
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

39:05.200 --> 39:08.280
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

39:08.400 --> 39:11.720
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

39:12.120 --> 39:15.680
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

39:15.760 --> 39:21.480
♪With no one it can be brought♪

39:26.440 --> 39:33.360
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

39:33.800 --> 39:40.640
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

39:41.120 --> 39:48.120
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

39:48.440 --> 39:52.480
♪Even if it means this flower♪

39:52.600 --> 39:59.560
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

40:10.680 --> 40:13.800
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

40:13.880 --> 40:17.120
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

40:17.480 --> 40:21.160
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

40:21.280 --> 40:27.840
♪No longer needing to say♪

40:31.920 --> 40:38.840
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

40:39.240 --> 40:46.200
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

40:46.560 --> 40:53.560
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

40:53.920 --> 40:55.600
♪And finding♪

40:55.680 --> 41:02.680
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
